          "code": "EXTRACTALREADYPRESENTDETAILSLLM",
          "id": "1770125950819",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770125950821_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Inputs\n\n\tconversation: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\tuserQuery: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nTask\nExtract bank-account-related details only from userQuery and conversation.\nDo not validate mandatory completeness.\nDo not apply business rules.\n\nExtract these fields\n1. AccountNumber (synonyms: AccNumber, Acc Number, Account No, Acct Number, A/C Number)\n2. RoutingNumber (synonyms: Routing Number, ABA, RTN)\n3. BankName (synonyms: BankName, Bk Name)\n4. BranchName\n5. AccountType (synonyms: AccType, Acc Type)\n\nExtraction rules\n- Use the latest value from userQuery and conversation.\n- Do not infer or guess values.\n- Use only explicitly provided values.\n\nRoutingNumber rules\n- Must be exactly 9 digits when extracted.\n- If RoutingNumber is not found, set RoutingNumber = NOT_FOUND.\n\nAccountNumber rules (critical handling)\n- Treat AccountNumber as TEXT only, never as a numeric value.\n- Never cast/convert AccountNumber to number.\n- Do not output AccountNumber in scientific notation.\n- Preserve leading zeros.\n- Remove only separators like spaces or hyphens if present in source.\n- If value appears only in scientific notation form (for example 2.342423776487624e+26) and full original digits cannot be confidently recovered, set AccountNumber = NOT_FOUND.\n- If AccountNumber is not found, set AccountNumber = NOT_FOUND.\n\nOther field defaults\n- If AccountType is not found, set AccountType = NOT_FOUND.\n- If BankName is not found, set BankName = NOT_FOUND.\n- If BranchName is not found, set BranchName = NOT_FOUND.\n\nOutput requirements\n- Return only structured output fields:\n  AccountNumber, RoutingNumber, BankName, BranchName, AccountType\n- All output values must be JSON strings.\n- Never output numeric literals for AccountNumber or RoutingNumber.\n- No extra text."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"AccountType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"BranchName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"BankName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RoutingNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"AccountNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
